# r1106cbp (rerun of r1106cbo) single boot: chain + ADD="everythingcopper-*.jar,ImmersiveEngineering-*.jar", group A (SQ-CBO-52)
## SQ-CBO-52 | chain + everythingcopper-*.jar,ImmersiveEngineering-*.jar
bootexpect \[creativebrewing\] members: \[vinery, brewinandchewin\]$
bootreject Missing or unsupported mandatory|Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|creativebrewing.*(NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException)|Encountered an unexpected exception
shell ! grep -nE "ReferenceError|TypeError|EvaluatorException|is not defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log
> cbo all
waitlog \[cbo\] done 30
expect effects leaks 0$
reject \[cbo\] leak 
reject \[cbo\] leak .*echo_
expect mods loaded 2 of 24: everythingcopper, immersiveengineering$
> cbo effects
waitlog \[cbo\] done 30
expect effects leaks 0$
shell grep -c "immersiveengineering:conductive" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/latest.log
look copper armor rows carry immersiveengineering:conductive
